  "body": "Location, Lifestyle, Takapuna\r\n\r\nOffering an impressive 58m² of internal living, this well-sized two room apartment includes a generous bedroom and separate study with its own wardrobe, providing the flexibility.\r\n \r\nProperty Highlights: \r\n* Generous 58m² floor area\r\n* Spacious separate bedroom\r\n* Large flexi room with built-in wardrobe\r\n* Open plan kitchen, dining and living\r\n* Modern bathroom\r\n* Excellent first-home or investment opportunity\r\n* Carpark included\r\n\r\nPrime Takapuna Location: Enjoy easy access to Takapuna Beach, local cafes, restaurants, shopping and public transport, with convenient motorway connections.\r\n\r\nZoned for sought-after schools: including Takapuna School, Takapuna Normal Intermediate, Belmont Intermediate, Takapuna Grammar School and Westlake Girls High School.",
